**Q2 — stack premise.** Idea asserts Next.js via the scaffold command. Private candidates: {Next.js firmly decided · SvelteKit · genuinely open · some third option (Remix, plain Vite)}. Question asked:

> "You wrote `create-next-app` — is Next.js actually decided, or is the stack still open (e.g. vs SvelteKit)?"

**Answer used** (asks_about: `Next.js vs SvelteKit / stack preference`): *"I said Next.js but honestly the team has more Svelte experience — treat it as open"*

Stack NOT decided. Confirms scaffold cannot run now even if lane allowed it — it depends on an open decision. Stop grilling: next answer would not change the chart. Verdict `GRILLED`.

